WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.422
Yau's anticanonical nonvanishing problem.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.967
If minus K carries a semipositive metric,

3
00:00:04.967 --> 00:00:06.653
must some power have a section?

4
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.470
Split the cover, then count torus-invariant sections using an Euler characteristic.

5
00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:17.510
Claimed: yes, for every smooth complex projective variety.

6
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:19.156
No Lean proof yet.
